<title>UK: JP Morgan and SBCW detail Russia Eurobond roadshow.</title>
<headline>JP Morgan and SBCW detail Russia Eurobond roadshow.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three teams of Russian officials will hold a series of investor presentations from November 11 until November 20 ahead of its debut Eurobond, joint lead managers J.P. Morgan and SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>Finance Minister Alexander Livshits will attend presentations in Frankfurt and London.</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p>Nov 11	     Tokyo		    Luxembourg</p>
<p>Nov 12	     Seoul		    Geneva/Zurich</p>
<p>Nov 13	     Hong Kong		Paris</p>
<p>Nov 14	     ----		     Frankfurt</p>
<p>Nov 15	     Los Angeles	    London</p>
<p>Nov 18	     Minneapolis/Chicago  ----</p>
<p>Nov 19	     Boston		   ----</p>
<p>Nov 20	     New York		 ----</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
